usage: measure_phone_capacity.py [-h] [--serial SERIAL] [--apk APK]
                                 [--out OUT] [--steps STEPS]
                                 [--budget-fraction BUDGET_FRACTION]
                                 [--reserve-mib RESERVE_MIB]
                                 [--granularity GRANULARITY]
                                 [--timeout TIMEOUT]

Measure real Android full-state capacity through the installed Dawnwood app.
No phone measurement is implied by this file existing. Run only with an
authorized ADB device. This measures completed circulation and health, not CPU
equivalence.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --serial SERIAL
  --apk APK             Optionally install this APK and record its SHA256
  --out OUT
  --steps STEPS
  --budget-fraction BUDGET_FRACTION
  --reserve-mib RESERVE_MIB
  --granularity GRANULARITY
  --timeout TIMEOUT
